  "prompt": "For each channel, what was the median order value from January to June 2025, rounded to whole euros? Use the sales rows whose order_date falls from 1 January to 30 June 2025, both days included (order_date is a UTC day). An order's value is the sum of net_revenue_eur over its lines. The median is the middle order value once the channel's orders are sorted by value; with an even number of orders, it is the average of the two middle values. Return two columns, in this order: channel and median_order_eur. Return one row for each channel with sales in that period. Any row order is fine.",
